    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但自他漂民本藩在留中相與候飯米鹽噌代始一躰之諸入費平均ニ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但（ただ）し、自他（じた）の漂民（ひょうみん）本藩在留中、相与（あいあた）へ候（そうろう）飯米（はんまい）・塩噌（えんそ＝塩味噌）代を始め、一体（いったい）の諸入費を平均に…"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Provided that: for castaways from this and other domains, during their stay in the domain, the rice-provisions and salt-and-miso costs supplied to them, and all such miscellaneous expenses taken together, [given here] as an average..."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "tsushima_note_castaway_provisions"
